                            <h2>Executing Live Migration &amp; Sync Verification</h2>
                        </div>
                        <p>
                            Once you have audited the dry-run diffs and confirmed that no unwanted modifications will occur:
                        </p>
                        <ol style="margin-left: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                            <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Click the <span class="mm-btn-badge mm-btn-primary">Run</span> button in the job header.</li>
                            <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">A native confirmation dialog prompts you to confirm. Click <strong>OK</strong>.</li>
                            <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
                                If <code>run_in_background</code> is enabled, the run enters state <code>queued</code> and processes asynchronously.
                                Otherwise, it executes immediately, updating progress in real time.
                            </li>
                            <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
                                Upon completion, the run marks state as <code>done</code> with status <code>applied</code> across all applied change records.
                            </li>
